    "detailed_description": "In this game, you are a first person character that has been taken away from the earth and put into a real life nightmare because of your past sins. You must escape through different dimensions and fight multiple creatures with different abilities and weapons to come back to earth.<br><strong><br>CAGE LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/08d3f64fc5fe5b3957334c5ff995fe5b.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>In this level, you are put in a cage. There are security cameras watching you that are broadcasting it live on television, you are also being watched by other creatures. You must find hints to escape alive.<br><br><strong>PLAY ROOM LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/e110958295682fd5abeca2e75ed90b55.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>After escaping the cage, you find a way to a different dimension where whales want to eat you and everything looks un natural, there is water everywhere and more creatures that are also holding you back from escaping back to reality. <br><br><strong>PLAY GROUND LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/f458630bf640920f7c415239031ab9b5.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>You're in the forest and find a castle, complete puzzles without dying to creatures to move on to the next.<br><br><strong>MANSION LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/969316ba6f4496703e34bb2ae9180d2c.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>This is the final level where you make it into the demons house, you must break in, steal his loot and defeat him to avenge your suffering.",
    "about_the_game": "In this game, you are a first person character that has been taken away from the earth and put into a real life nightmare because of your past sins. You must escape through different dimensions and fight multiple creatures with different abilities and weapons to come back to earth.<br><strong><br>CAGE LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/08d3f64fc5fe5b3957334c5ff995fe5b.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>In this level, you are put in a cage. There are security cameras watching you that are broadcasting it live on television, you are also being watched by other creatures. You must find hints to escape alive.<br><br><strong>PLAY ROOM LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/e110958295682fd5abeca2e75ed90b55.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>After escaping the cage, you find a way to a different dimension where whales want to eat you and everything looks un natural, there is water everywhere and more creatures that are also holding you back from escaping back to reality. <br><br><strong>PLAY GROUND LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/f458630bf640920f7c415239031ab9b5.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>You're in the forest and find a castle, complete puzzles without dying to creatures to move on to the next.<br><br><strong>MANSION LEVEL</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011480/extras/969316ba6f4496703e34bb2ae9180d2c.avif?t=1726618078\" /></div><br>This is the final level where you make it into the demons house, you must break in, steal his loot and defeat him to avenge your suffering.",
